          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>The &quot;Standard&quot; field has a &quot;value list&quot; format: use &quot;;&quot; and &quot;/&quot; as separators.
The &quot;Standard&quot; field has a &quot;range&quot; format: use &quot;-&quot; as a separator, with numeric values ​​to the left and right of the separator.
